OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses fear latest roadworks
OL,4,Awill hit trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses are bracing themselves for
OL,7,Fmonths of disruption as Hull City
OL,8,FCouncil begins a new roadworks project
OL,9,Fon a major route in the city.
OL,11,FThe authority said six months of work
OL,12,Fwould begin on Monday on Freetown Way
OL,13,Fto turn it back into two lanes for
OL,14,Ftraffic and move the cycle lane on to
OL,15,Fthe pavement.
OL,17,FRichard Hall, the landlord of The
OL,18,FCounty pub, said: "It will impact me
OL,19,Fdramatically if people can't cross
OL,20,FFreetown Way. I'll lose footfall."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
