OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses fear latest roadworks
OL,4,Awill hit trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Ieronimo, the council's portfolio
OL,7,Fholder for transportation, roads and
OL,8,Fhighways, said: "We're very sensitive
OL,9,Fto the impact on businesses and we'll
OL,10,Fdo everything that we can to make sure
OL,11,Fthat we minimise the impact for them."
